    {
      "modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-flash",
      "content": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "Aquí tienes la consulta SQL para BigQuery que identifica las diez comorbilidades más frecuentes en pacientes diagnosticados con los conceptos de Diabetes Mellitus que has especificado:\n\n```sql\nWITH DiabetesPatients AS (\n    SELECT DISTINCT\n        co.person_id\n    FROM\n        `condition_occurrence` co\n    WHERE\n        co.condition_concept_id IN (193323, 195771, 201254, 201820)\n),\nComorbidities AS (\n    SELECT\n        co.person_id,\n        co.condition_concept_id\n    FROM\n        `condition_occurrence` co\n    JOIN\n        DiabetesPatients dp ON co.person_id = dp.person_id\n    WHERE\n        co.condition_concept_id NOT IN (193323, 195771, 201254, 201820)\n)\nSELECT\n    c.concept_name AS ComorbidityName,\n    COUNT(DISTINCT cm.person_id) AS NumberOfPatients\nFROM\n    Comorbidities cm\nJOIN\n    `concept` c ON cm.condition_concept_id = c.concept_id\nWHERE\n    c.domain_id = 'Condition' -- Asegura que solo contamos otras condiciones\n    AND c.standard_concept = 'S' -- Solo conceptos estándar\nGROUP BY\n    ComorbidityName\nORDER BY\n    NumberOfPatients DESC\nLIMIT 10\n```",
